<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK</p>
<p>company results expected in week ending June 20 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS-----RANGE----------PVS</p>
<p>MONDAY, June 16</p>
<p>British Steel Plc     F  PFT	  460.7	450.0-485.0   1,102.0</p>
<p>				 DIV	   10.0	    10.0	   10.0</p>
<p>				 EPS	   15.8	 15.0-16.4	 38.3</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a</p>
<p>consensus</p>
<p>forecast of PFT 460.0 DIV 10.0 EPS 15.8)</p>
<p>TUESDAY, June 17</p>
<p>Carpetright Plc	 F  PFT	   31.5	 29.5-32.4	 25.2</p>
<p>				 DIV	   18.7	 17.5-19.8	 14.5</p>
<p>				 EPS	   27.0	 25.1-27.7	 22.3</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a</p>
<p>consensus</p>
<p>forecast PFT 32.5 DIV 18.7 EPS 27.0)</p>
<p>Thames Water Plc     F   PFT	  368.8	350.0-384.0     228.7</p>
<p>				 DIV	   34.5	    34.5	   28.3</p>
<p>				 EPS	   82.4	 79.5-84.9	 50.7</p>
<p>(Edinburgh Financial Publishing's estimate directory shows a</p>
<p>consensus</p>
<p>forecast PFT 369.0 DIV 34.5 EPS 83.0)</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>			     ----oOo----</p>
